msgstr ""

#: opti-behavior/includes/tooltip-helper.php:878
msgid "Heatmap Sessions"
msgstr ""

#: opti-behavior/includes/tooltip-helper.php:879
msgid ""
"The number of visitor sessions included in this heatmap. More sessions = "
"more accurate data. Pages with few sessions may not show reliable patterns."
msgstr ""

#: opti-behavior/includes/tooltip-helper.php:880
msgid "How many visits this heatmap is based on. More = better!"
msgstr ""

#: opti-behavior/includes/tooltip-helper.php:891
msgid ""
"The number of distinct human visitor sessions on this page for the selected "
"period, with spam excluded. Sessions are counted once across all URL "
"variants of the same page. This is the same number shown on the Heatmaps "
